B.bcA=new A.fj("c5","Hard Cases","Breakers target your modules, not the core. Layer your Lasers and survive 4 waves.",0,0,4,4,320,30,18,1200,820,B.a1Q,-1,"Breakers are slow and tough and chew your buildings. Put lasers where they can cover your extractors and each other.")
