B.b0C=new A.mT("h5","Anchors","Cheap, tough, structural \u2014 the square holds the wall.",0,5,5,210,1000,700,B.Mf,2,"Anchors are cheap and tough \u2014 the corners of your cheapest loops. Stretch your territory with them and save the flux for guns.")
B.b0z=new A.mT("h6","Bastion","Wall the core: something heavy leads the sixth wave.",0,6,6,220,1000,700,B.Mf,-1,"A loop with mostly Anchors is a BASTION \u2014 its whole ring, nodes and edges, takes half damage. Wall the core before the sixth wave: the Mass grinds straight for it.")
B.b0B=new A.mT("h7","Claim under fire","Territory wins this one \u2014 grow your claim while waves keep coming.",1,12e3,-1,220,1000,700,B.Mf,-1,"This one is won by AREA, not by outlasting waves. Push loops outward behind bastion walls and keep drawing.")
B.b0w=new A.mT("h8","Prisms","The amplifier arrives: hexagons make everything nearby stronger.",0,7,7,240,1000,700,B.ke,4,"A loop with mostly Prisms is RESONANT \u2014 every field sharing a corner with it works half again as hard. Weave one between your power and kill fields.")
B.b0F=new A.mT("h9","Resonance","A big claim under constant pressure \u2014 make the geometry sing.",1,24e3,-1,240,1200,820,B.ke,-1,"Chain resonant loops through your territory: boosted power fields fund boosted kill fields. Claim the target area while the waves keep coming.")
B.b0G=new A.mT("h10","The long watch","Nine waves. The Mass leads every third one from the sixth.",0,9,9,240,1000,700,B.ke,-1,"The Mass crushes nodes and edges alike and only stops when it or your core is gone. Layer kill fields on its path and bastion the inner ring.")
B.b0t=new A.mT("h11","Thin flux","Nearly broke. Earn your territory one bounty at a time.",1,15e3,-1,130,1000,700,B.ke,-1,"You start nearly broke \u2014 one small Well loop is all you can afford. Grow income first; every kill pays a bounty too.")
B.b0r=new A.mT("h12","The broad plane","A huge plane, a huge claim. Make the frontier pay for itself.",1,36e3,-1,260,1300,880,B.ke,-1,"Big loops pay best \u2014 chain outward and let resonance carry the frontier. The waves never stop, so neither should the drawing.")
B.b0E=new A.mT("h13","Deep grind","Twelve waves, three Masses. Hold, rebuild, hold again.",0,12,12,260,1200,820,B.ke,-1,"Twelve waves and a Mass on every third from the sixth. Bastion the inner ring and rebuild fast between waves.")
B.b0u=new A.mT("h14","Perfect form","The finale. Fifteen waves \u2014 everything the plane can throw.",0,15,15,280,1300,880,B.ke,-1,"Fifteen waves of everything at once. Balance income, walls, guns and resonance \u2014 and keep the core standing.")
