B.cSJ=new A.p("linesAsset2",B.D,"A SECOND, independent GeoJSON asset of LineString/MultiLineString features, drawn alongside linesAsset \u2014 lets one map combine a filtered layer (e.g. linesAsset + linesFilterProperty for a per-selection hub route tree) with an always-on one (e.g. linesAsset2 with no linesFilterProperty2, for a full network of links) at the same time, since one filter can't apply to only some features in one asset.",B.f,null)
