B.cVN=new A.p("dense",B.V,'Compact single-line reading ("26 articles") with no tile chrome \u2014 no card background, border, or min-size. Several dense stats plus a plain "\xb7" text node between them read as one line, an alternative to the dashboard-header tile row for a context that just wants the numbers, not a KPI header. Unset = the tile below.',B.f,null)
