B.cT5=new A.p("todayLabel",B.D,'Optional bright text (e.g. "HERE") drawn beside the today line. Unset draws just the line, byte-identical to before this prop existed.',B.f,null)
B.d2k=new A.p("todayColor",B.D,"Optional colour for the today marker line \u2014 one of the same named ramp values as statusColors (green/blue/amber/red/grey/purple), or a #RGB/#RRGGBB/#AARRGGBB hex string. Use this to move the marker off red when red is already reserved as the one blocked-status accent. Unset/unrecognized keeps the original hard-coded red, byte-identical to before this prop existed.",B.f,null)
B.cZy=new A.p("height",B.D,'Optional height. Unset with an UNBOUNDED slot (desktop / page scroll) keeps the historic intrinsic content height. Given a BOUNDED slot (phone) \u2014 or an explicit value \u2014 the timeline fills that height and pans INTERNALLY on both axes (a long plan gets a legible per-day width and scrolls sideways instead of squeezing). Accepts a number (logical px), "fill" (the full available body height, scrolling/panning internally), or "<frac>fill" (e.g. "0.55fill").',B.f,null)
