B.cUU=new A.p("treeRail",B.V,"Two-level: column 1 becomes a DIRECTORY TREE \u2014 folders nest (sub-projects), non-folders are leaves, and the tree never descends into a non-folder (a task's children are its log). Column 2 then lists the selected folder's non-folder children only.",B.f,null)
B.cSp=new A.p("rail2Folders",B.V,"Two-level + treeRail: ALSO list the selected project's SUB-PROJECTS (child folders) at the top of column 2, above its tasks \u2014 tapping one drills into it (becomes column 2's root). Off = column 2 is tasks only.",B.f,null)
